- project = @notification.project
- fee_pct = ENV.fetch('PLATFORM_FEE', '5.0').tr(',', '.').to_f / 100.0
- gross = project.contributions.where(payment_method: 'Stripe', stripe_transferred: true).sum(:value).to_f
- gross = project.contributions.where(payment_method: 'Stripe', state: 'confirmed').sum(:value).to_f if gross == 0
- net = (gross * (1.0 - fee_pct)).round(2)
- currency_sym = project.currency || 'EUR'

|Hello #{project.user.display_name},
br
br
|Your payment for project #{link_to(project.name, project_url(project))} is in progress.
br
|The funds are on their way to your bank account.
br
br
table[style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 500px;"]
  tr[style="background: #f8fafc;"]
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Project
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"] #{project.name}
  tr
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Collected amount
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"] #{number_to_currency(gross, unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')}
  tr
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Commission
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"] #{number_to_currency((gross * fee_pct).round(2), unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')}
  tr[style="background: #f0fdf4;"]
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; font-weight: bold;"] Amount to receive
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold;"] #{number_to_currency(net, unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')}
br
br
|The payment usually arrives within 2 to 7 business days.
br
|You will receive another email when the funds have arrived on your bank account.
br
br
|Thank you,
br
|The #{Configuration[:company_name]} team
